 </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">geeft </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">elektronica </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">een </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">tweede </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">leven </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">en </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">helpt </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">zo </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">verspilling </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">te </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">verminderen. </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Uiteraard </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">krijg </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">je </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">bij </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">aankoop </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">1 </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">maand </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">garantie, </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">zodat </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">je </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">met </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">een </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">gerust </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">gevoel </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">kunt </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">genieten </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">van </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">je </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">muziek </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">met </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">deze </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">fijne </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Soundcore </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">koptelefoon.</span></p>",
